  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This 5-year (2021-2026) technical assistance and capacity development programme aims to strengthen good governance, public financial management and accountability, and transparency of the public sector in the MENA region and to improve the impact of the Court of Audits&apos; work in their national and in international contexts.The programme is a follow-up to a previous cooperation between the Courts of Audit, which ran from 2016 to 2021.</narrative>
  </description>
